<title>USA: Mercury General sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Mercury General sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mercury General Corp said Monday its board has approved a two-for-one stock split and declared a regular quarterly dividend of $0.29 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on the pre-split shares on September 30 to holders of record on September 16, it said.</p>
<p>The new shares will be issued on October 9, 1997, the first anniversary of the company's listing on the New York Stock Exchange, to holders of record on September 16, it said.</p>
</text>
